{"id": "EUVD-2026-88559", "enisaUuid": "43d26fae-63dd-39c5-9ede-028f9e18034c", "description": "SiYuan versions before v3.8.4 fail to properly validate SQL statements in block query embed blocks executed against siyuan.db. Attackers can craft malicious .sy documents with non-read-only SQL statements that execute automatically during background indexing, rendering, or export operations without authentication.", "datePublished": "2026-09-28T22:00:17", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-29T18:01:40", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/security/advisories/GHSA-67p9-hm94-xwf3", "https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/commit/e8ace0c89182c7ee1a1298ff2a849bb6a83dfdec", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/siyuan-before-3.8.4-sql-injection-via-block-query-embed"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-101091", "GHSA-7fjj-5cqf-p4pm"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.26, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "f90a1787-8cb5-3646-a376-f21a5222f92b", "product": {"name": "SiYuan", "vendor": {"name": "siyuan-note"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.8.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "7ef9a9f0-a871-3ca3-8ca3-225564687fba", "vendor": {"name": "siyuan-note"}}], "isExploited": false}